Config Schema
typescriptinterface ThumbnailNodeConfig {
  source: 'existing' | 'reference' | 'fresh';
  
  // If source = 'existing'
  existingElementId?: string;
  
  // If source = 'reference' or 'fresh'
  prompt?: string;  // May contain @mentions and {variables}
  
  // Style
  aspectRatio: '16:9' | '1:1' | '9:16';
  mood?: string;
}
Runtime Behavior
If source = 'existing':

Fetch element by ID
Return element URL as thumbnail
No generation, no cost

If source = 'reference':

Parse @mentions from prompt
Call /api/elements/resolve to get reference image URLs
Replace {title}, {topic} variables with actual values
Call Gemini Imagen with prompt + reference images
Return generated image

If source = 'fresh':

Replace {title}, {topic} variables
Call Gemini Imagen with prompt only
Return generated image


