Warnings
Don't Do These Things
❌ Don't add other image generators — Gemini Imagen only
❌ Don't store images in browser — Everything persists to Supabase
❌ Don't make tags case-sensitive — Normalize to lowercase
❌ Don't allow duplicate tags per element — Deduplicate on save
❌ Don't skip thumbnails — Generate previews for fast loading
❌ Don't forget to update used_count — Track element usage
Watch Out For
⚠️ Large file uploads — Limit to 10MB, validate on client and server
⚠️ Missing elements at runtime — Handle gracefully if @tag doesn't resolve
⚠️ Race conditions — User might delete element while pipeline is running
⚠️ Storage costs — Consider cleanup of unused elements

